  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specimen Collection Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From July 6-8, 2016, the specimen collection workshop was conducted in Myanmar. United States Department of Agriculture, Animal and Plant Health Inspection Service (USDA APHIS) Bangkok hosted the One Health Specimen Collection Workshop in Mandalay, Myanmar, July 6-8, 2016. This 3-day workshop, included lectures and demonstrations. APHIS collaborated with Myanmar Livestock Breeding and Veterinary Department (LBVD) in organizing the workshop.</narrative>
  </description>
